build/
build-*/

# CUBRID leaves its database artifacts in $CUBRID_DATABASES, which defaults to the
# working directory. Scripts here are supposed to point it at a scratch dir, but
# a stray run must not be committable: a database volume is 128 MB and GitHub
# refuses it outright.
databases.txt
csql.err
csql.access
lob/
*_lgat
*_lgar_t
*_lginf
*_vinf
*_keys
*_dwb
*_lgat__lock
*_loaddb.log
*_unloaddb.log
